        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saunders_Lake%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The waters of Saunders Lake support diverse aquatic life, including bluegill, largemouth bass, yellow perch, and stocked rainbow trout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
